      "caption": "Weight loss mistakes 👇 A calorie deficit is always king when it comes to losing weight. “Healthy eating” is subjective, and the seemingly “healthier” choice isn’t always the better choice for your goals. I’m not saying to live off junk food if it’s low calorie, but I am saying you should understand how all foods can fit when you’re trying to lose weight. Examples mentioned: 👇 🍰Cheesecake Factory - Chinese Chicken Salad = 1630 calories - SkinnyLicious Crispy Chicken Sandwich = 560 calories 🥤Tropical Smoothie Cafe - Mocha Madness = 810 calories - Blueberry Bliss add scoop of whey = 440 calories 🥑Breakfast - Avocado toast = 500 calories (depending on bread/avocado size) - 2 Eggs on English muffin = 260 calories 🍿Snack - 1 cup of granola = 390 calories - 1 cup of popcorn = 70 calories ✨Follow for more ✨ #nutrition #weightloss #personaltraining #fitness",
